+    on one scatter address, and 3+ such addends cost exactness (2 commute
+    safely). REPAIR, 2026-09-02: the flat kernel (`forcedirected/flat_batch.py`)
+    replaced SELL-C-sigma and has no hub split and no virtual row at all --
